<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Afore Solida Banorte gets new boss.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Afore Solida Banorte gets new boss.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Othon Ruiz Montemayor, head of banking group Grupo Financiero Banorte, on Monday appointed Enrique Castillon Vega as the new boss of pension fund management firm Afore Solida Banorte.</p>
<p>Castillon, who will continue to head the banking group's Savings and Provisions division, replaces Jose Ramon Palacios, who returns to the banking group as a senior advisor.</p>
<p>(-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
